        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>地球的圈层结构 —— 关于\"地球外部圈层\"</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body{\n    font-family:\"SimSun\",\"Songti SC\",serif;\n    font-size:15px;\n    line-height:1.9;\n    color:#000;\n    margin:0;\n    padding:28px 34px;\n    background:#fff;\n  }\n  .page{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;}\n  .red{color:#d0021b;}\n  .red-u{color:#d0021b;text-decoration:underline;}\n  .u{text-decoration:underline;}\n  p{margin:2px 0;}\n  .indent1{margin-left:0;}\n  .indent2{margin-left:1.6em;}\n  h3.sec{\n    font-size:15px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    margin:8px 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  h2.title{\n    color:#d0021b;\n    font-size:19px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    text-align:center;\n    margin:32px 0 14px 0;\n    letter-spacing:1px;\n  }\n  table{\n    width:100%;\n    border-collapse:collapse;\n    table-layout:fixed;\n  }\n  table, th, td{\n    border:1px solid #000;\n  }\n  th{\n    font-weight:bold;\n    text-align:center;\n    padding:4px 6px;\n    font-size:15px;\n    letter-spacing:6px;\n  }\n  td{\n    padding:6px 8px;\n    vertical-align:middle;\n    font-size:14px;\n    line-height:1.85;\n  }\n  td.rowhead{\n    width:44px;\n    text-align:center;\n    font-weight:normal;\n    letter-spacing:0;\n  }\n  col.c1{width:46px;}\n  col.c2{width:44%;}\n  .bottom-note{\n    margin-top:10px;\n    font-size:15px;\n    line-height:2;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <p>（2）地幔分为<span class=\"red-u\">上地幔</span>和<span class=\"red-u\">下地幔</span>。上地幔上部一定范围内的岩石因高温呈熔融状态，该部位被称为<span class=\"red-u\">软</span></p>\n  <p><span class=\"red-u\">流</span>层，该层被认为是<span class=\"red-u\">岩浆</span>发源地。</p>\n  <p>（3）地壳和软流层以上的地幔部分，由<span class=\"red-u\">岩石</span>组成，统称为岩石圈<span class=\"u\">。</span></p>\n\n  <h3 class=\"sec\">3.地核</h3>\n  <p>（1）外核物质接近<span class=\"red-u\">液</span>态，主要是由<span class=\"red-u\">铁、镍</span>等元素组成的熔融体。</p>\n  <p>（2）内核物质可能为<span class=\"red-u\">固</span>态，刚性很强，由在极高压状态下结晶的<span class=\"red-u\">铁镍合金</span>组成，密度极<span class=\"red-u\">大</span><span class=\"u\">　</span>。</p>\n\n  <h2 class=\"title\">二、关于\"地球外部圈层\"</h2>\n\n  <table>\n    <colgroup>\n      <col class=\"c1\">\n      <col class=\"c2\">\n      <col>\n    </colgroup>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th colspan=\"2\">特　点</th>\n        <th>对地球环境的意义</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"rowhead\">大<br>气<br>圈</td>\n        <td>\n          由<span class=\"red-u\">干洁空气</span>、<span class=\"red-u\">水汽</span>和微小颗粒组成；<br>\n          <span class=\"red-u\">厚度大</span>，有<span class=\"red-u\">连续性</span>；<br>\n          分布不均，50%的气体集中在<span class=\"red-u\">0-6 千米</span><br>\n          的低空大气层（<span class=\"red-u\">对流</span>层）中。\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          大气圈能调节地球温度，避免流星体撞击地球，吸收大部分紫外线和高能带电粒子流，保护地球生命。\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"rowhead\">水<br>圈</td>\n        <td>\n          以气态、液态、固态三种形式存在于空中、地表和地下。具有<span class=\"red-u\">连续性</span>。分布不均，主要分布在<span class=\"red-u\">海洋</span>。是地球特有的圈层。\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          拥有水圈是地球特有的环境优势；<br>\n          水圈能调节气候（降低温差）、净化大气、塑造地表形态（如<span class=\"red-u\">流水</span>地貌、<span class=\"red-u\">喀斯特</span>地貌、<span class=\"red-u\">海岸</span>地貌）；<br>\n          是地球生命存在和人类延续和发展的必要条件\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"rowhead\">生<br>物<br>圈</td>\n        <td>\n          是地球上所有<span class=\"red-u\">生物</span>及其<span class=\"red-u\">生存环境</span>的总称；<br>\n          生物圈的核心层（生物膜）位于<span class=\"red-u\">地表以</span><br>\n          <span class=\"red-u\">上 100 米到水下 200 米</span>的大气圈、水圈、岩石圈的交界处。\n        </td>\n        <td>\n          生物圈是大气圈、水圈、岩石圈长期演化、相互作用的结果；<br>\n          生物圈参与对大气圈、水圈和岩石圈的改造，对地表物质循环、能量转换具有特殊作用。<br>\n          生物圈是地球上最<span class=\"red-u\">大</span>的生态系统，是<span class=\"red-u\">地球</span>独有的圈层。\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-note\">\n    大气圈、水圈、生物圈、岩石圈相互<span class=\"red-u\">联系</span>、相互<span class=\"red-u\">渗透</span>、相互<span class=\"red-u\">影响</span>，形成人类赖以生存和发展的自然环境。\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
